                                        "entry_id": "606f72b7-05c9-31e0-93ad-1c0160d52280",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cell in the skin that produces the pigment melanin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76084549-6c5a-49c0-bbd3-803278ff3ee4",
                                                "sense_id": "ed7ea9da-593b-3c3e-b895-69d966c047bf",
                                                "text": "As previously stated, it is pigmented, this pigmentation depending upon the so-called melanocytes."
                                            }
